 sensitive to noise. Mental fatijfuc,\nnausea and vertigo, worse in a closed room."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"ears","label":"Ears","startLine":33352,"endLine":33354,"text":"Roaring and ringing ; voice sounds strange ;\nears seem to close up suddenly."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"abdomen","label":"Abdomen","startLine":33355,"endLine":33357,"text":"Pain in bowels ; relieved by stool. De-\nsire for stool immediately after eating. Dysentery."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"female","label":"Female","startLine":33358,"endLine":33361,"text":"Dysmenorrhoea, with bearing-down pains,\ntenderness, drawing in groins. Menses suppressed ;\nlater, profuse."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"respiratory","label":"Respiratory","startLine":33362,"endLine":33364,"text":"Hurried, labored, stertorous respira-\ntion. Frothy mucus obstructs the air-passages."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"relationship","label":"Relationship","startLine":33365,"endLine":33367,"text":"Compare: Cimicif.; Cina; Absinth.\nNux follows well."}],"corpusPassages":[]}